							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="section-prose reveal">
					<p>
						The output for "cat" is a weighted blend: 46% from its own value vector, 33% from
						"sat," and 21% from "The." The representation now encodes contextual
						information — "cat" has been updated to reflect its relationship with the
						surrounding tokens.<span class="sn-marker" data-sn="sn-kvcache">14</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				{/* 04e: Inside One Attention Head — Stepped Walkthrough */}
				<div class="subsection-divider"></div>
				<h3 class="subsection-title">04e: Inside One Attention Head</h3>

				<div class="linkage-callout reveal linkage-attention">
					<span class="linkage-icon">&#8599;</span>
					<span><strong>Synthesis</strong> — Sections 04a–04d covered each component in isolation. This walkthrough opens the black box
